sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as 前端 Web UI
    participant WS as FastAPI WebSocket
    participant ROUTE as route.py
    participant SVC as service.py
    participant APR as approval.py
    participant SDK as claude_agent_sdk
    participant NORM as normalizer.py

    Note over UI,SDK: 用户发了一条 prompt，Claude 想用工具
    UI->>WS: { type: "claude-command", command: "...", options: {...} }
    WS->>ROUTE: 分发
    ROUTE->>SVC: queryClaudeCode(command, options, ws)
    SVC->>SDK: query(prompt, options) — async iterator
    SDK->>APR: can_use_tool(toolName, input, ctx)
    activate APR
    Note over APR: requestId = ctx.tool_use_id<br/>创建 asyncio.Future
    APR->>NORM: { kind: "permission_request", requestId, toolName, input }
    NORM-->>UI: WebSocket push (经 ws.send_text)
    UI->>UI: 弹审批 UI
    UI-->>WS: { type: "claude-permission-response", requestId, allow: true }
    WS->>ROUTE: 分发
    ROUTE->>APR: resolve_approval(requestId, decision)
    APR->>APR: Future.set_result(decision)
    APR-->>SDK: PermissionResultAllow(updated_input=input)
    deactivate APR

    Note over SDK: SDK 继续，执行工具
    SDK-->>SVC: AssistantMessage(ToolUseBlock)
    SVC->>NORM: handle
    NORM-->>UI: { kind: "tool_use", toolName, toolInput, toolId }
    SDK-->>SVC: UserMessage(ToolResultBlock)
    SVC->>NORM: handle
    NORM-->>UI: { kind: "tool_result", toolId, content, isError }

    Note over UI,SDK: 拒绝路径同理：APR 返回 PermissionResultDeny<br/>SDK 自动产生 ToolResultBlock(is_error=True) 由 normalizer 去重丢掉
